sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser (React)
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant D as SQLite

    B->>A: POST /api/auth/login (email, password)
    A->>D: Find user by email
    D-->>A: User and password hash
    A->>A: Verify password with bcrypt
    alt Credentials valid
        A->>A: Create JWT (expires in 24 hours)
        A-->>B: 200 user data + httpOnly cookie
        B->>A: Later requests (cookie sent automatically)
        A->>A: Decode JWT and load user
        A-->>B: Protected data
    else Credentials invalid
        A-->>B: 401 error message
    end
